{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りのバッグが次々へと壊れていく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく丁寧に使っているはずなのになんでぼろぼろになっちゃうんだろう(´._.`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてことを毎日考えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、気にせず使っちゃうんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケチだから(  ｰ̀ωｰ́ )✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだケチ泉は卒業できないみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケチすぎて最近今後が心配になってきています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"”ほどよくケチでいこう”"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんからもらったリュック♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7ER7KXC3XHC9HGR020GC0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}